Arara Code: workspace trust prompt on open, short dialog.

- arara.defaults.ts: security.workspace.trust.startupPrompt = 'always'
  (VSCodium ships 'never', so untrusted folders opened silently in restricted mode).
- workspace.contribution.ts: startup dialog reduced to question, one line,
  folder path and two buttons (Confiar / Modo restrito), no button sublabels.

Why a patch: the dialog text is hard-coded in the workbench; the default
can't be set from product.json.
Touches: src/vs/workbench/common/arara.defaults.ts,
         src/vs/workbench/contrib/workspace/browser/workspace.contribution.ts

